<title>RUSSIA: Rouble falls to 3,621 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble falls to 3,621 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble fell to 3,621 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,584 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 4		   Nov 1</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,621		   3,584</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    0.06		    4.50</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
